omx-contract (0.24.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: omx-contract 0.24.2 (0.24.1 to 0.24.2), a patch
  * ci: Debian is trixie only, no bookworm cell behind the full switch
  * release: a staged dispatch builds the full matrix by default, quick only
    when asked
  * release: omx-contract 0.24.1 (0.24.0 to 0.24.1), a patch
  * contract-dir: contractRoots() asks pkg-config once per process and keeps
    its answer
  * publish.yml: npm publishes with an explicit --tag latest, so the 0.M.m
    line can replace 3.x
  * release: the 0.24.0 debian/changelog entry is dated after 0.23.4's
  * release: the 0.24.0 changelog names #246, the semver x-since check folded
    in
  * release: omx-contract 0.24.0 (0.23.3 to 0.24.0), a minor
  * semver: an item new since the previous tag says the domain release that
    ships it
  * The resource-hints factory's get is called on the main thread
  * RESOURCE_HINTS names its factory: the same hints by plugin id, before any
    instance

